<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine ups Sino Land warrants.</title>
<headline>Peregrine ups Sino Land warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Monday it has increased its issue of American style call warrants on shares of Sino Land Co Ltd by 160 million warrants to 660 million warrants.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$9.98     PREMIUM	 22.86 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1569   GEARING	 6.0X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  17.NOV.97   PAYDATE	 17.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG   MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$9.40</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
